      ],
      "message": "validation: make every package transaction evicted by the final trim reconsiderable\n\nPackage transactions can also be in the mempool before the final trim\nby having been accepted by themselves earlier in the same call, or by\nbeing there already, possibly with a different witness. Make them\nTX_RECONSIDERABLE too when evicted: they are evicted for their feerate\nlike the others and may still be accepted in a package.",
